CLEX File Manager HTML documentation
====================================

This HTML documentation can be converted to a CLEX help-file using
the html2help (or H2H) utility available upon request.

The on-line help slightly differ from the HTML documentation and this
is why the H2H supports limited set of preprocessing commands which
allow to include or exclude parts of the HTML document.


<!-- H2H!hide -->
	this HTML code is visible in a browser,
	but does not appear in the help-file
<!-- H2H!show -->


<!-- H2H!only
	this HTML code is not visible in a browser,
	but appears in the help-file
H2H!only -->
